    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 23,
      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming reception and compassionate veterinarians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers repeatedly praise Dr. Farrington, Dr. Osterheld, and receptionist Brianna for providing warm, attentive, and comforting care. Pet owners appreciate that front desk staff recognize returning pets by name and maintain a welcoming environment. While one client noted a shift toward corporate policies, the overwhelming majority describe the veterinary staff as deeply caring and approachable."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient handling for feisty and nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners of difficult, vocal cats and highly nervous dogs frequently note the staff's exceptional patience during veterinary exams. Several clients mention that assistants calmly work with feisty felines and provide holistic comforts, including soothing techniques after surgeries. Pet parents appreciate that their animals are handled gently and treated with genuine kindness."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affordable rates with occasional billing concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients commend the clinic for maintaining some of the most affordable treatment rates in Phoenix, frequently assisting with cost-effective options and complimentary services. However, several reviewers voiced frustration over recent price increases, mandatory wellness exam charges, or high fees during terminal illness treatments. Overall, opinions on clinic costs remain mixed."
      }
    }
  ],
